cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JevAlt, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "JevAlt: Open Decision Models with the Jev API"
abstract: "Three open 4B decision models (Deem-4B for English, Karar-4B for Turkish, Wähler-4B for German) that answer typed questions with a calibrated probability for every option. They speak the Jev API and run on a CPU in about 3 GB of RAM."
